line":50,"original_start_line":50,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":52,"original_line":52,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1885213017,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":9,"position":9,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1886518956","pull_request_review_id":2505696680,"id":1886518956,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5wcf6s","diff_hunk":"@@ -849,11 +849,11 @@\n \t\t\t\t[codeblocks]\n \t\t\t\t[gdscript]\n \t\t\t\tvar a = [1, 2, 3]\n-\t\t\t\tprint(\"a\", \"b\", a) # Prints ab[1, 2, 3]\n+\t\t\t\tprint(\"a\", \"b\", a) # Prints \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"","path":"doc/classes/@GlobalScope.xml","commit_id":"ca4b29b18dcd41831c79ba986bd07ef9bf9e838e","original_commit_id":"1fb50ad9bf3e3aed7e89882c6bd1ec2d61de199c","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looking at this example specifically, I wonder if a policy that is to use quotes for strings but not for number types is the right one.\r\n\r\nWhat gets printed is:\r\n```\r\nab[1, 2, 3]\r\n```\r\nwhich doesn't differ much from the output of `print(42)` or `print(\"ab[1, 2, 3]\")`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nvar a = [1, 2, 3]\r\nprint(\"a\", \"b\", a)\r\nprint(\"ab[1, 2, 3]\")\r\nprint(42)\r\n```\r\nprints:\r\n```\r\nab[1, 2, 3]\r\nab[1, 2, 3]\r\n42\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo maybe we should use quotes *all the time* and not just for strings?","created_at":"2024-12-16T09:57:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T09:57:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99876#discussion_r1886518956","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99876","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1886518956"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99876#discussion_r1886518956"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99876"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1886518956/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":853,"original_line":853,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":48,"position":48,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1887605995","pull_request_review_id":2507393260,"id":1887605995,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5wgpTr","diff_hunk":"@@ -849,11 +849,11 @@\n \t\t\t\t[codeblocks]\n \t\t\t\t[gdscript]\n \t\t\t\tvar a = [1, 2, 3]\n-\t\t\t\tprint(\"a\", \"b\", a) # Prints ab[1, 2, 3]\n+\t\t\t\tprint(\"a\", \"b\", a) # Prints \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"","path":"doc/classes/@GlobalScope.xml","commit_id":"ca4b29b18dcd41831c79ba986bd07ef9bf9e838e","original_commit_id":"1fb50ad9bf3e3aed7e89882c6bd1ec2d61de199c","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'll leave that up for you or someone else to decide. Doing this is bikeshedding a bit and would be a whole lot more lines to change, but I do not mind doing it so long as it's consistent.","created_at":"2024-12-16T21:27:12Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T21:27:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99876#discussion_r1887605995","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99876","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1887605995"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99876#discussion_r1887605995"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99876"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1887605995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":853,"original_line":853,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1886518956,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":48,"position":48,"subject_type":"line"}]